Subject: [PATCH 002/105] feat: NGRAM_CHAIN request-local suffix-match chain
 draft provider

Registers an EAGLE-family provider that drafts speculative_num_steps tokens
by suffix-matching the request's own history (prompt + committed output) and
skips the MTP draft forwards entirely on full-batch hits; any miss falls back
to the unchanged NEXTN chain. One-hot draft_probs keep rejection sampling
exact at temperature > 0.

CPU-only unit tests; GPU validation checklist in NGRAM_CHAIN.md.
Implemented by Codex (gpt-5.6-sol high) under supervisor review.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
